#: simcontrols.js:35
msgid ""
"Ferric chloride undergoes hydrolysis with <br/>boiling distilled water to "
"form ferric hydroxide sol."
msgstr ""
"Ferric chloride undergoes hydrolysis with <br/>boiling distilled water to "
"form ferric hydroxide sol."

#: simcontrols.js:35
msgid ""
"On adding silver nitrate to water,<br/> a white precipitate of silver "
"chloride is produced immediately,<br/> which indicates the presence of "
"chloride ions and hence, NaCl in water. <br/>It means that chloride ions "
"diffuse through the parchment membrane."
msgstr ""
"On adding silver nitrate to water,<br/> a white precipitate of silver "
"chloride is produced immediately,<br/> which indicates the presence of "
"chloride ions and hence, NaCl in water. <br/>It means that chloride ions "
"diffuse through the parchment membrane."

#: simcontrols.js:35
msgid ""
"No white precipitate is formed,<br/> indicating that Cl<sup>-</sup> ions are "
"absent and dialysis is complete."
msgstr ""
"No white precipitate is formed,<br/> indicating that Cl<sup>-</sup> ions are "
"absent and dialysis is complete."

