"Aluminium chloride undergoes hydrolysis with boiling<br>distilled water to "
"form aluminium hydroxide sol."
msgstr ""
"Aluminium chloride undergoes hydrolysis with boiling<br>distilled water to "
"form aluminium hydroxide sol."

#: simcontrols.js:37
msgid ""
"On adding silver nitrate to water, a white precipitate of silver<br>chloride "
"is produced immediately, which indicates the presence<br of chloride ions "
"and hence, NaCl in water. It means that<br>chloride ions diffuse through the "
"parchment membrane."
msgstr ""
"On adding silver nitrate to water, a white precipitate of silver<br>chloride "
"is produced immediately, which indicates the presence<br of chloride ions "
"and hence, NaCl in water. It means that<br>chloride ions diffuse through the "
"parchment membrane."

#: simcontrols.js:37
msgid ""
"No white precipitate is formed, indicating that<br>Cl<sup>-</sup> ions are "
"absent and dialysis is complete. "
msgstr ""
"No white precipitate is formed, indicating that<br>Cl<sup>-</sup> ions are "
"absent and dialysis is complete. "

